(7662100, 1248934, 96815, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick, a nice moment captured and a beautiful photo.</td>', 'This is my top pick, a nice moment captured and a beautiful photo.', '2020-05-10 11:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662101, 1248462, 96815, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective. I believe this is the ''colour run'', correct? I''m curious to see how it would look... in colour. hah.<br/> <br/>I still really appreciate the desaturation and contrast of the image. Highly rated.</td>', 'Awesome perspective. I believe this is the ''colour run'', correct? I''m curious to see how it would look... in colour. hah. I still really appreciate the desaturation and contrast of the image. Highly rated.', '2020-05-10 11:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662102, 1248792, 96815, '<td valign="top">Good use of long-exposure to magnify the emotion in the photo. I like the low perspective and composition as well. Can''t find anything I would change. Nice</td>', 'Good use of long-exposure to magnify the emotion in the photo. I like the low perspective and composition as well. Can''t find anything I would change. Nice', '2020-05-10 11:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662104, 1248486, 96815, '<td valign="top">Ah good ol'' Toronto subway. It''s interesting to have a perspective from afar when usually someone would be jammed up along side that crowd. I''m guessing this was shot through an open door after you thought to yourself "I''ll catch the next one!"<br/> <br/>Nice job on pulling a subject out of a busy image. Although she looks like she doesn''t appreciate it as much, I do. Great photo.</td>', 'Ah good ol'' Toronto subway. It''s interesting to have a perspective from afar when usually someone would be jammed up along side that crowd. I''m guessing this was shot through an open door after you thought to yourself "I''ll catch the next one!" Nice job on pulling a subject out of a busy image. Although she looks like she doesn''t appreciate it as much, I do. Great photo.', '2020-05-10 11:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662105, 1248765, 96815, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting shot from an unusual perspective. I think I would prefer to be in line with the level of the floor to see the entirety of the ''crowd'' - get up on those tippy-toes! Also, although the capture of the stairs is the unique part of the image, I probably would have taken it down to the 1/3rd to give a more appealing balance. All in all, one of the stand-out images of the challenge, nice job.</td>', 'It''s an interesting shot from an unusual perspective. I think I would prefer to be in line with the level of the floor to see the entirety of the ''crowd'' - get up on those tippy-toes! Also, although the capture of the stairs is the unique part of the image, I probably would have taken it down to the 1/3rd to give a more appealing balance. All in all, one of the stand-out images of the challenge, nice job.', '2020-05-10 11:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662106, 1248854, 96815, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic capture of the long-cast shadows. It leads the eyes to the crowd and then is nicely completed by the Louvre in the background.<br/> <br/>It may be an optical illusion, but the horizon tilt seems a little off to me.</td>', 'I like the dramatic capture of the long-cast shadows. It leads the eyes to the crowd and then is nicely completed by the Louvre in the background. It may be an optical illusion, but the horizon tilt seems a little off to me.', '2020-05-10 11:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662107, 1248693, 96815, '<td valign="top">Yep, a little rain won''t keep the Brits indoors! It''s a busy image (I understand that is the idea), but I struggle to come up with a point of interest.</td>', 'Yep, a little rain won''t keep the Brits indoors! It''s a busy image (I understand that is the idea), but I struggle to come up with a point of interest.', '2020-05-10 11:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662109, 1248949, 96815, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the contrast of the near-silhouettes against the city-scape. I''m not sure how much I appreciate the traffic post in this shot though.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the contrast of the near-silhouettes against the city-scape. I''m not sure how much I appreciate the traffic post in this shot though.', '2020-05-10 11:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662110, 1248320, 96815, '<td valign="top">Ah I never thought the nose-bleeds would look so good! Beautiful image. I can almost hear the crowd.</td>', 'Ah I never thought the nose-bleeds would look so good! Beautiful image. I can almost hear the crowd.', '2020-05-10 11:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662111, 1248909, 96815, '<td valign="top">I like this. There is a story to be found if you are observant enough. Nice job.</td>', 'I like this. There is a story to be found if you are observant enough. Nice job.', '2020-05-10 11:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662112, 1248895, 96815, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. Great job on pulling a subject out of this, and great expression captured!</td>', 'This is pretty cool. Great job on pulling a subject out of this, and great expression captured!', '2020-05-10 11:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662113, 1248826, 96815, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines down the coast and moody colours. It''s a bummer however that the main subject (in my opinion, the man looking at the camera) is partially blocked from view.</td>', 'Nice leading lines down the coast and moody colours. It''s a bummer however that the main subject (in my opinion, the man looking at the camera) is partially blocked from view.', '2020-05-10 11:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
