(7662510, 1248792, 91360, '<td valign="top">first time for me on the front page! Wow!<br/>Image taken 2 years ago in NYC near times square.<br/>I figured it will fit this pandemia time..strange to see so many people so close ha? over here in Israel they released us to go from home only a week ago.<br/>I was traveling with my wife and 2 more couples and noticed this guy. immediately i thought long exposure will do great here..yet i didn''t had any tripod..<br/>so I decided to try to pot my camera on the nearest block and tried my best.<br/>Happy to see it did great.</td>', 'first time for me on the front page! Wow!Image taken 2 years ago in NYC near times square.I figured it will fit this pandemia time..strange to see so many people so close ha? over here in Israel they released us to go from home only a week ago.I was traveling with my wife and 2 more couples and noticed this guy. immediately i thought long exposure will do great here..yet i didn''t had any tripod..so I decided to try to pot my camera on the nearest block and tried my best.Happy to see it did great.', '2020-05-13 18:20:12.000000', NULL, 0),
